messages "mangla**To: darFwd:  StrikeDate: Mar 27To: manglaFwd:  StrikeDate: Mar 27To: redsexySubj: StrikeCc: sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27I propose a coding strike, to let the arches know that we are not going toput up with their shit anymore.  They have had THREE YEARS to get this mudback together, and so far they've failed miserably.  Furthermore, they'veallowed personal vandettas to hinder the progress of the mud.I suggest the following conditions to begin coding again:1.  Reinstate Tatsuo.  That's a given.  He's done more for this mud in a    month than all of the arches did in three years.2.  Demote ALL inactive arches.  Kryll, Magnal, Sauron, Airborne.  These four    have done nothing for three years.  Sauron has been \"working on the lib\",    Airborne comes in to read boards, and Kryll hasn't done shit.  As for    Magnal - who the hell is Magnal?  3.  Mangla must either step down from arch or promote at    LEAST one more arch in order to balance the power.If you agree to this, post it.  If not, do whatever you like.  Personally,I don't see the point of having the mud if things stay as they are.**"
